        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-65_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-65_46983_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-814_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-814_46998_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-815_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-815_46997_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-2753_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-2753_47443_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-65_46983_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>The cost-of-service results have been updated to reflect the most current interpretation of the FERC methodology outlined in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC 61, 377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-814_46998_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Long-Term portion of Finance Lease Obligations.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-815_46997_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Current portion of Finance Lease obligations.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2753_47443_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none">The cost of service results were calculated using the Cost of Service Model.This Model calculates cost of service using the Trended Original Cost methodology promulgated by the FERC in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC 61,377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings. </span><br /></p></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrl>